flowchart LR
  MB[Shared Mailbox] --> MC[Mailbox Connector]
  MC --> DS[Document Store]
  MC --> REG[Invoice Registry]
  REG --> EXT[Extraction Service]
  EXT --> MAT[Matching Service]
